### Test Lab Test Categories API with Date Range Filtering

### 1. Basic request without date filtering (should work as before)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Test date range filtering with fromdate and toDate
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Test single date filtering (legacy support)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?createdAtDate=2024-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Test with additional filters combined with date range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&status=active&limit=5&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Test with name search and date range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&name=blood
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Test invalid date format (should return 400 error)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=invalid-date&toDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Test only fromdate provided (should work)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=2024-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Test only toDate provided (should work)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?toDate=2024-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Create a test category first (for testing date filtering)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Test Category for Date Filter",
  "description": "This is a test category created to verify date range filtering",
  "status": "active"
}

### 10. Test pagination with date range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/lab-test-categories?fromdate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&limit=2&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}